id=garnet_oos16_uw_fix
name=Garnet Native Lens Switch & Camera Fix
version=v1.4
versionCode=140
author=Vael
description=Universal zero-overlay anti-bootloop camera & lens switch fix for garnet (OOS16, HyperOS 1/2/3 CN/Global/ID/EU, Lunaris & AOSP; Magisk/KSU/APatch): post-boot bind-mounts only, universal dynamic ARM64 chi_override resolver, strict ELF/pattern checks with safe fallback, native Photo/Video SAT lens switching, surgical Titan570 Luma-only NR bypass (100% Chroma NR active), active 0.6x UW LDC, and boosted video bitrates.
